a pot\xe9 aplikaci restartujte, aby se tyto zm\u011bny projevily.",biom_10times:"Pokusili jste se zadat heslo 10\xd7. Chcete obnovit \xfalo\u017ei\u0161t\u011b? T\xedm odstran\xedte v\u0161echny pen\u011b\u017eenky a de\u0161ifrujete \xfalo\u017ei\u0161t\u011b.",biom_conf_identity:"Potvr\u010fte pros\xedm svoji identitu.",biom_no_passcode:"Va\u0161e za\u0159\xedzen\xed nem\xe1 povolen\xe9 odemyk\xe1n\xed pomoc\xed p\u0159\xedstupov\xe9ho k\xf3du nebo biometriky. Abyste mohli pokra\u010dovat, nastavte pros\xedm p\u0159\xedstupov\xfd k\xf3d nebo biometriku v aplikaci Nastaven\xed.",biom_remove_decrypt:"V\u0161echny va\u0161e pen\u011b\u017eenky budou odstran\u011bny a va\u0161e \xfalo\u017ei\u0161t\u011b bude de\u0161ifrov\xe1no. Opravdu chcete pokra\u010dovat?",currency:"M\u011bna",currency_source:"Kurz je z\xedsk\xe1v\xe1n z",currency_fetch_error:"P\u0159i z\xedsk\xe1v\xe1n\xed kurzu vybran\xe9 m\u011bny do\u0161lo k chyb\u011b.",default_desc:"Pokud je mo\u017enost zak\xe1z\xe1na, BlueWallet p\u0159i spu\u0161t\u011bn\xed ihned otev\u0159e vybranou pen\u011b\u017eenku.",default_info:"V\xfdchoz\xed pen\u011b\u017eenka",default_title:"P\u0159i spu\u0161t\u011bn\xed",default_wallets:"Zobrazit v\u0161echny pen\u011b\u017eenky",electrum_connected:"P\u0159ipojeno",electrum_connected_not:"Nep\u0159ipojeno",electrum_error_connect:"K poskytnut\xe9mu Electrum serveru se nelze p\u0159ipojit",electrum_error_connect_tor:"K zadan\xe9mu Electrum serveru se nelze p\u0159ipojit. Ujist\u011bte se pros\xedm, \u017ee aplikace Orbot je p\u0159ipojena a zkuste to znovu.",lndhub_uri:"Nap\u0159. {example}",electrum_host:"Nap\u0159. {example}",electrum_offline_mode:"Offline re\u017eim",electrum_offline_description:"Pokud je tato funkce povolena, va\u0161e bitcoinov\xe9 pen\u011b\u017eenky se nebudou pokou\u0161et na\u010d\xedtat z\u016fstatky nebo transakce.",electrum_port:"Port, obvykle {example}",use_ssl:"Pou\u017e\xedt protokol SSL",electrum_saved:"Va\u0161e zm\u011bny byly \xfasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b ulo\u017eeny. Zm\u011bny se projev\xed a\u017e po restartu aplikace BlueWallet.",set_electrum_server_as_default:"Nastavit {server} jako v\xfdchoz\xed Electrum server?",set_lndhub_as_default:"Nastavit {url} jako v\xfdchoz\xed LNDhub server?",electrum_settings_server:"Electrum server",electrum_status:"Stav",electrum_preferred_server:"Up\u0159ednost\u0148ovan\xfd server",electrum_preferred_server_description:"Zadejte server, kter\xfd m\xe1 va\u0161e pen\u011b\u017eenka pou\u017e\xedvat pro v\u0161echny bitcoinov\xe9 aktivity. Po nastaven\xed bude va\u0161e pen\u011b\u017eenka pou\u017e\xedvat v\xfdhradn\u011b tento server ke kontrole z\u016fstatk\u016f, odes\xedl\xe1n\xed transakc\xed a na\u010d\xedt\xe1n\xed s\xed\u0165ov\xfdch dat. P\u0159ed nastaven\xedm se ujist\u011bte, \u017ee tomuto serveru d\u016fv\u011b\u0159ujete.",electrum_unable_to_connect:"Nelze se p\u0159ipojit k {server}.",electrum_history:"Historie",electrum_reset_to_default:"Toto nastaven\xed nech\xe1 aplikaci BlueWallet n\xe1hodn\u011b vybrat server ze seznamu navrhovan\xfdch.",electrum_reset:"Obnovit do v\xfdchoz\xedho nastaven\xed",electrum_reset_to_default_and_clear_history:"Obnovit v\xfdchoz\xed nastaven\xed a vymazat historii",encrypt_decrypt:"De\u0161ifrovat \xfalo\u017ei\u0161t\u011b",encrypt_decrypt_q:"Opravdu chcete de\u0161ifrovat \xfalo\u017ei\u0161t\u011b? To umo\u017en\xed p\u0159istupovat k va\u0161im pen\u011b\u017eenk\xe1m bez hesla.",encrypt_enc_and_pass:"\u0160ifrovat a chr\xe1nit heslem",encrypt_storage_explanation_headline:"Povolit \u0161ifrov\xe1n\xed \xfalo\u017ei\u0161t\u011b",encrypt_storage_explanation_description_line1:"Povolen\xed \u0161ifrov\xe1n\xed \xfalo\u017ei\u0161t\u011b p\u0159id\xe1v\xe1 dal\u0161\xed vrstvu zabezpe\u010den\xed pro va\u0161i aplikaci zp\u016fsobem, jak\xfdm jsou va\u0161e data ukl\xe1d\xe1na na va\u0161em za\u0159\xedzen\xed. Toto komukoliv zt\u011b\u017euje p\u0159\xedstup k va\u0161im informac\xedm bez va\u0161eho povolen\xed.",encrypt_storage_explanation_description_line2:"Nicm\xe9n\u011b je d\u016fle\u017eit\xe9 v\u011bd\u011bt, \u017ee toto \u0161ifrov\xe1n\xed chr\xe1n\xed pouze p\u0159ed p\u0159\xedstupem k pen\u011b\u017eenk\xe1m ulo\u017een\xfdm na va\u0161em za\u0159\xedzen\xed. Pen\u011b\u017eenky t\xedmto nejsou nijak zaheslov\xe1ny nebo ochr\xe1n\u011bny dal\u0161\xed vrstvou zabezpe\u010den\xed.",i_understand:"Rozum\xedm",block_explorer:"Block Explorer",block_explorer_preferred:"Pou\u017e\xedt up\u0159ednostn\u011bn\xfd prohl\xed\u017ee\u010d blok\u016f",block_explorer_error_saving_custom:"B\u011bhem ukl\xe1d\xe1n\xed up\u0159ednostn\u011bn\xe9ho prohl\xed\u017ee\u010de blok\u016f nastala chyba",encrypt_title:"Zabezpe\u010den\xed",encrypt_tstorage:"\xdalo\u017ei\u0161t\u011b",encrypt_use:"Pou\u017e\xedt {type}",set_as_preferred:"Nastavit jako preferovan\xfd",set_as_preferred_electrum:"Nastaven\xed {host}:{port} jako up\u0159ednost\u0148ovan\xe9ho serveru zak\xe1\u017ee n\xe1hodn\xe9 p\u0159ipojov\xe1n\xed k navrhovan\xe9mu serveru.",encrypted_feature_disabled:"Tato funkce nem\u016f\u017ee b\xfdt pou\u017eita, pokud je povoleno za\u0161ifrovan\xe9 \xfalo\u017ei\u0161t\u011b.",encrypt_use_expl:"{type} bude pou\u017eit k potvrzen\xed va\u0161\xed identity p\u0159ed proveden\xedm transakce, odemknut\xedm, exportem nebo smaz\xe1n\xedm pen\u011b\u017eenky. {type} nebude pou\u017eit k odemknut\xed za\u0161ifrovan\xe9ho \xfalo\u017ei\u0161t\u011b.",biometrics_fail:"Pokud {type} nen\xed povolen, nebo sel\u017ee p\u0159i odemyk\xe1n\xed, m\u016f\u017eete jako alternativu pou\u017e\xedt p\u0159\xedstupov\xfd k\xf3d va\u0161eho za\u0159\xedzen\xed.",general:"Obecn\xe9",general_continuity:"Kontinuita",general_continuity_e:"Pokud je povolena, budete moci prohl\xed\u017eet vybran\xe9 pen\u011b\u017eenky a transakce pomoc\xed ostatn\xedch za\u0159\xedzen\xed p\u0159ipojen\xfdch k Apple iCloud.",groundcontrol_explanation:"GroundControl je bezplatn\xfd open source server push ozn\xe1men\xed pro bitcoinov\xe9 pen\u011b\u017eenky. M\u016f\u017eete si nainstalovat sv\u016fj vlastn\xed server GroundControl a vlo\u017eit sem jeho URL, abyste se nespol\xe9hali na infrastrukturu BlueWallet. Chcete-li pou\u017e\xedt v\xfdchoz\xed server, ponechte pole pr\xe1zdn\xe9.",header:"Nastaven\xed",language:"Jazyk",last_updated:"Naposledy aktualizov\xe1no",language_isRTL:"Aby se projevila zm\u011bna nastaven\xed jazyka, je nutn\xe9 restartovat BlueWallet.",license:"Licence",lightning_error_lndhub_uri:"Neplatn\xfd LNDhub URI",lightning_error_lndhub_uri_tor:"Neplatn\xe1 LNDhub URI. Ujist\u011bte se pros\xedm, \u017ee aplikace Orbot je p\u0159ipojena a zkuste to znovu.",lightning_saved:"Va\u0161e zm\u011bny byly \xfasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b ulo\u017eeny.",lightning_settings:"Nastaven\xed Lightning",lightning_settings_explain:"Nainstalujte si pros\xedm LNDhub a vlo\u017ete jeho URL zde v nastaven\xed, abyste se mohli p\u0159ipojit k vlastn\xedmu LND uzlu. Vezm\u011bte pros\xedm na v\u011bdom\xed, \u017ee ke specifikovan\xe9mu LNDhubu se p\u0159ipoj\xed pouze pen\u011b\u017eenky vytvo\u0159en\xe9 a\u017e po ulo\u017een\xed zm\u011bn.",network:"S\xed\u0165",network_broadcast:"Odeslat transakci",network_electrum:"Electrum server",electrum_suggested_description:"Pokud nebude nastaven preferovan\xfd server, bude n\xe1hodn\u011b vybr\xe1n navrhovan\xfd server.",not_a_valid_uri:"Neplatn\xe1 URI",notifications:"Ozn\xe1men\xed",open_link_in_explorer:"Otev\u0159\xedt odkaz v pr\u016fzkumn\xedku",password:"Heslo",password_explain:"Zadejte heslo, kter\xe9 budete pou\u017e\xedvat pro odem\u010den\xed \xfalo\u017ei\u0161t\u011b.",plausible_deniability:"V\u011brohodn\xe1 popiratelnost",privacy:"Soukrom\xed",privacy_read_clipboard:"Kop\xedrovat ze schr\xe1nky",privacy_system_settings:"Syst\xe9mov\xe1 nastaven\xed",privacy_quickactions:"Z\xe1stupci pen\u011b\u017eenky",privacy_quickactions_explanation:"Dlouh\xfd stisk ikony BlueWallet na va\u0161\xed v\xfdchoz\xed obrazovce zobraz\xed v\xe1\u0161 z\u016fstatek.",privacy_clipboard_explanation:"Poskytnout zkratky, pokud se ve va\u0161\xed schr\xe1nce nach\xe1z\xed adresa nebo faktura.",privacy_do_not_track:"Zak\xe1zat analytiku",privacy_do_not_track_explanation:"Informace o v\xfdkonu a spolehlivosti nebudou odes\xedl\xe1ny k anal\xfdze.",rate:"Kurz",push_notifications_explanation:"Povolen\xedm ozn\xe1men\xed bude token va\u0161eho za\u0159\xedzen\xed odesl\xe1n na server spole\u010dn\u011b s adresami pen\u011b\u017eenky a transak\u010dn\xedmi ID od v\u0161ech pen\u011b\u017eenek a transakc\xed proveden\xfdch po povolen\xed ozn\xe1men\xed. Token za\u0159\xedzen\xed je vyu\u017e\xedv\xe1n k odes\xedl\xe1n\xed ozn\xe1men\xed a informace o pen\u011b\u017eence n\xe1m umo\u017e\u0148uje informovat v\xe1s o p\u0159\xedchoz\xedch bitcoinech nebo o potvrzen\xed transakc\xed.\n\nJsou vys\xedl\xe1ny pouze informace od t\xe9 doby, co povol\xedte ozn\xe1men\xed \u2013 z d\u0159\xedv\u011bj\u0161\xed doby nejsou \u017e\xe1dn\xe9 informace shroma\u017e\u010fov\xe1ny.\n\nZak\xe1z\xe1n\xedm ozn\xe1men\xed odstran\xedte v\u0161echny tyto informace ze serveru. Odstran\u011bn\xedm pen\u011b\u017eenky z aplikace takt\xe9\u017e dojde k odebr\xe1n\xed jej\xedch souvisej\xedc\xedch informac\xed ze serveru.",selfTest:"Autotest",save:"Ulo\u017eit",saved:"Ulo\u017eeno",success_transaction_broadcasted:"Va\u0161e transakce byla \xfasp\u011b\u0161n\u011b odesl\xe1na!",total_balance:"Celkov\xfd z\u016fstatek",total_balance_explanation:"Zobrazte celkov\xfd z\u016fstatek v\u0161ech va\u0161ich pen\u011b\u017eenek na widgetech na domovsk\xe9 obrazovce.",widgets:"Widgety",tools:"N\xe1stroje"},notifications:{would_you_like_to_receive_notifications:"Chcete dost\xe1vat ozn\xe1men\xed o p\u0159\xedchoz\xedch platb\xe1ch?",notifications_subtitle:"P\u0159\xedchoz\xed platby a potvrzen\xed transakc\xed",no_and_dont_ask:"Ne, a u\u017e se m\u011b znovu neptejte.",permission_denied_message:"Nem\xe1te povolen\xe9 opr\xe1vn\u011bn\xed pro zas\xedl\xe1n\xed ozn\xe1men\xed. Jestli\u017ee chcete dost\xe1vat ozn\xe1men\xed, povolte opr\xe1vn\u011bn\xed v nastaven\xed va\u0161eho za\u0159\xedzen\xed."},transactions:{cancel_explain:"Tuto transakci nahrad\xedme takovou, kter\xe1 v\xe1m zaplat\xed a bude m\xedt vy\u0161\u0161\xed poplatky. T\xedm se zru\u0161\xed aktu\xe1ln\xed transakce. Toto se naz\xfdv\xe1 RBF \u2013 Replace by Fee.",cancel_no:"Tato transakce nen\xed nahraditeln\xe1.",cancel_title:"Zru\u0161it tuto transakci (RBF)",transaction_loading_error:"B\u011bhem na\u010d\xedt\xe1n\xed transakce do\u0161lo k probl\xe9mu. Zkuste to pros\xedm znovu pozd\u011bji.",transaction_not_available:"Transakce nen\xed dostupn\xe1",confirmations_lowercase:"{confirmations} potvrzen\xed",copy_link:"Zkop\xedrovat odkaz",expand_note:"Rozbalit pozn\xe1mku",cpfp_create:"Vytvo\u0159it",cpfp_exp:"Vytvo\u0159\xedme dal\u0161\xed transakci, kter\xe1 utrat\xed va\u0161i nepotvrzenou transakci. Celkov\xfd poplatek bude vy\u0161\u0161\xed ne\u017e p\u016fvodn\xed transak\u010dn\xed poplatek, tak\u017ee by m\u011bl b\xfdt t\u011b\u017een rychleji. Tomu se \u0159\xedk\xe1 CPFP \u2013 Child Pays for Parent (d\xedt\u011b plat\xed za rodi\u010de).",cpfp_no_bump:"Tuto transakci nelze popostr\u010dit.",cpfp_title:"Poplatek za popostr\u010den\xed (CPFP)",details_balance_hide:"Skr\xfdt z\u016fstatek",details_balance_show:"Zobrazit z\u016fstatek",details_copy:"Zkop\xedrovat",details_copy_block_explorer_link:"Zkop\xedrovat odkaz na pr\u016fzkumn\xedk blok\u016f",details_copy_note:"Zkop\xedrovat pozn\xe1mku",details_copy_txid:"Zkop\xedrovat ID transakce",details_from:"Vstup",details_inputs:"Vstupy",details_outputs:"V\xfdstupy",date:"Datum",details_received:"P\u0159ijato",details_view_in_browser:"Zobrazit v prohl\xed\u017ee\u010di",details_title:"Transakce",incoming_transaction:"P\u0159\xedchoz\xed transakce",outgoing_transaction:"Odchoz\xed transakce",expired_transaction:"Expirovan\xe1 transakce",pending_transaction:"\u010cekaj\xedc\xed transakce",offchain:"Of